{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"final"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PersistencePlugin"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"State"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Action"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/DesignPrinciples","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginArchitecture","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistenceMiddlewareGuide","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/ArchitectureGuide","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/BuildingYourFirstApp","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddPersistence"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After each reducer call, drains "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ChangeSet"},{"type":"text","text":"s from registered "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntityStore"},{"type":"text","text":"s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"into "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StateWriter"},{"type":"text","text":" buffers. Restarts a debounce timer on each drain. When the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"timer fires, flushes all pending writes in a single "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Task"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A flush whose save fails is retried on a doubling backoff, bounded by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy"},{"type":"text","text":". Without that a failed save is silent data loss: the buffers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are cleared at flush time, so the write would only ever reach storage if the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"user happened to touch the same entity again. Running out of attempts is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reported through the writer rather than passing in silence, and the batch"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stays pending so a later edit or an explicit "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistencePlugin\/flush()"},{"type":"text","text":" tries once more."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Wiring","level":2,"anchor":"Wiring","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let persistence = PersistencePlugin<AppState, AppAction>(","    writers: [","        StateWriter(keyPath: \\.decks) { writes, deletes in ... },","        StateWriter(keyPath: \\.cards) { writes, deletes in ... },","    ],","    debounce: .milliseconds(250)",")","plugins.register(persistence)"]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/persistenceplugin"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PersistencePlugin"}],"roleHeading":"Class","externalID":"s:6Swidux17PersistencePluginC","symbolKind":"class","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"title":"PersistencePlugin","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PersistencePlugin"}]},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/StateWriter","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/UndoPlugin"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Persistence--Undo","title":"Persistence & Undo"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Coalescing persistence plugin."}],"identifier":{"u